<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20322" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βομβῠλι-ός</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βομβῠλι-ύλιος</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>buzzing insect: humble-bee</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>V.</u>
				107
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				10.12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				623b12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				629a29
			</span></i>; <i>gnat, mosquito</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>cocoon of the silk-worm</i> (
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βομβυλίς</span>
			), <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				551b12
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>narrow-necked vessel</i> that <i>gurgles</i> in pouring,
				<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Morb.</u>
				3.16
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				11(2).154
			</span></i><i><span class="en">
				<u>A</u>
				68
			</span></i> (Delos, <span class="entity">iii B. C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Socr.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				11.784d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Lex.</u>
				7
			</span></i>. (On the accent v.
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdn.
			</span></i> Gr.<i><span class="en">
				1.116
			</span></i>, al.)</div>
